{"id":"143b07a96594dcb5","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition.md","title":"ZFC Forcing4 Semiproper Condition","display":"df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition — ZFC Forcing4 Semiproper Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition — ZFC Forcing4 Semiproper Condition","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition — ZFC Forcing4 Semiproper Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5453c3145394e8bf\" href=\"?note=5453c3145394e8bf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S\\)</span> (semiproperness-witness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5453c3145394e8bf\" href=\"?note=5453c3145394e8bf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4SemiproperCondition}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4SemiproperCondition}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}semiproper\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4SemiproperCondition}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists p_0\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S(p,p_0,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}semiproper\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4SemiproperCondition}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists p_0\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S(p,p_0,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A semiproper condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is a semigeneric extension of some ground condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0\\in M\">\\(p_0\\in M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former self-call used <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> as both witness and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-condition, incorrectly forcing every semiproper condition to lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness","status":"resolved","id":"5453c3145394e8bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness","status":"resolved","id":"5453c3145394e8bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S$ (semiproperness-witness predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-forcing12-semiproperness-witness]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4SemiproperCondition}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing4\\text{-}semiproper\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4SemiproperCondition}_S(M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},p,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists p_0\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S(p,p_0,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p_0\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1284,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2097","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition.md|58-df-zfc-forcing4-semiproper-condition]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5453c3145394e8bf"]}